<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include("../partials/head") %></head>
<body class="page-verify">
  <%- include("../partials/header") %>
  <main class="contact-page">
    <%- include("../partials/page-hero", {
      eyebrow: "Evidence Notary",
      title: "Check a RootSystems report <em>yourself.</em>",
      lead: "Drop in a report and its signed manifest. Your browser checks the post-quantum signature, who signed it, and that not one byte has changed. No account, and nothing is uploaded.",
      compact: true,
      noVideo: true
    }) %>

    <section class="contact-section verify-agent">
      <div class="wrap contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-intro">
          <h2>Proof that does not ask you to trust us.</h2>
          <p>Every report from <%= products.map(function (p) { return p.name; }).join(", ") %> comes with a manifest: the report's fingerprint, its link to the report before it, and an ML-DSA-65 signature. This page repeats every check the product made, in your browser, with the key each product publishes.</p>
          <div class="contact-note">
            <strong>Your files stay on this device.</strong>
            <span>The checks run in this page. The only thing it fetches is the products' public signing keys.</span>
          </div>
          <p class="verify-hint">Where to find the files: in the product, open <strong>Reports</strong>, then download the PDF (and CSV if there is one) and the <strong>manifest</strong>. The timestamp proof (.ots) is optional.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="verify-agent__main">
          <form id="verify-form" class="contact-form" novalidate>
            <label class="form-field">
              <span>Signed manifest (.json), required</span>
              <input type="file" name="manifest" accept=".json,application/json" required>
            </label>
            <label class="form-field">
              <span>Report PDF</span>
              <input type="file" name="pdf" accept=".pdf,application/pdf">
            </label>
            <label class="form-field">
              <span>Report CSV, if the report has one</span>
              <input type="file" name="csv" accept=".csv,text/csv">
            </label>
            <label class="form-field">
              <span>Timestamp proof (.ots), optional</span>
              <input type="file" name="ots" accept=".ots">
            </label>
            <div class="contact-form__footer">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Verify report</button>
              <span>Nothing is uploaded.</span>
            </div>
          </form>
          <div id="verify-result"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include("../partials/footer") %>
  <script src="/js/site.js"></script>
  <script src="/vendor/ml-dsa65.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/verify.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
